  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the difference in specificity (%) between TBST and TST, by test pair: DST 5mm vs TST 5mm 57.26, DST AI vs TST 5mm 29.93, C-Tb vs TST 15mm 4.61, C-Tb vs TST 5/15mm −2.00 and C-TST vs TST 5mm 39.90. The overall random-effects pooled difference is 33.47 (18.16 to 48.78), favouring higher specificity for TBST, with high residual heterogeneity (I² = 96%).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
